OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto staff 'caught
OL,4,Ared-handed' in confidentiality breach,
OL,5,Atribunal hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of workers who were dismissed
OL,8,Ffrom Rockstar Games were "caught
OL,9,Fred-handed" flouting contractual
OL,10,Fpolicies and obligations, an employment
OL,11,Ftribunal has heard.
OL,13,FThe gaming giant behind Grand Theft
OL,14,FAuto said it took action after staff
OL,15,Fdiscussed confidential information on a
OL,16,FDiscord server which had hundreds of
OL,17,Fmembers.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
