OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto staff 'caught
OL,4,Ared-handed' in confidentiality breach,
OL,5,Atribunal hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt came during the company's closing
OL,8,Fspeech in a case brought by former
OL,9,Femployees who are claiming unfair
OL,10,Fdismissal for trade union activities. A
OL,11,Fjudgement is due at a later date.
OL,13,FRepresenting 23 workers, the
OL,14,FIndependent Workers' Union of Great
OL,15,FBritain (IWGB) said the former staff
OL,16,Fwere penalised for discussing working
OL,17,Fconditions in a private online forum.
